***PROJECT AETERNUM VERSION 1.0.0 DOCUMENTATION/INFO***
***PROJECT AETERNUM BUILT BY STARBOUNDSOLARIS***

This soundfont contains three separate soundfonts combined into one. 
The following soundfonts are currently included:
"Space Station 14 Soundfont"
"General User GS"
""Gm.sf2" Soundfont, Also known as the default soundfont for most devices that have Windows installed."

When editing MIDIs to use this soundfont, each instrument has been labelled as to correspond with which soundfont that they originated from.

GeneralUserGS Instruments are labelled with GUGS_
Windows Default Instruments are labelled with WNDWS_
SS14 Instruments are labelled with SS14_

